<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Discrete Probability Distributions - AIML Laboratory</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
            --primary-light: #eff6ff;
            --secondary: #4f46e5;
            --accent: #0d9488;
            --background: #f8fafc;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --border: #e2e8f0;
            --success: #10b981;
            --warning: #f59e0b;
            --danger: #ef4444;
            --radius-sm: 6px;
            --radius-md: 10px;
            --radius-lg: 16px;
            --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
            --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
            :root {
                --background: #0f172a;
                --surface: #1e293b;
                --text-main: #f8fafc;
                --text-muted: #94a3b8;
                --border: #334155;
                --primary-light: #1e3a8a;
            }
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--background);
            color: var(--text-main);
            line-height: 1.5;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        /* Header Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .header-container {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            height: 70px;
        }

        .logo-area {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .logo-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            color: white;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .logo-title {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            color: var(--primary);
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
        }

        .nav-btn.active {
            color: var(--primary);
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
        }

        /* Main Container */
        main {
            max-width: 1280px;
            margin: 2rem auto 0;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
        }

        .page-module {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out;
        }

        .page-module.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        /* Typography & Utility */
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-main); }
        h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* Layout Grids */
        .grid-2 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .grid-3 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .grid-5 {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        /* Cards & Panels */
        .card {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
            transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        .stat-card {
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 1.25rem;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-top: 4px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .stat-card .label {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .stat-card .formula {
            font-family: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin: 0.25rem 0;
        }

        .stat-card .value {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-top: 0.25rem;
        }

        /* Math Display */
        .math-block {
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
            font-family: "KaTeX_Main", "Times New Roman", serif;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            color: var(--text-main);
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        /* Form Controls */
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        input[type="number"], select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            background-color: var(--surface);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        input[type="number"]:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
        }

        .validation-msg {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--danger);
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
            display: none;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-hover);
        }

        .btn-secondary {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: var(--primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--primary);
        }

        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
        }

        /* SVG Chart Containers */
        .chart-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 340px;
            background-color: var(--surface);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 10px;
        }

        svg.chart {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: visible;
        }

        .bar {
            fill: var(--primary);
            transition: height 0.3s ease, y 0.3s ease, fill 0.2s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .bar:hover {
            fill: var(--secondary);
        }

        .bar-geometric { fill: var(--accent); }
        .bar-geometric:hover { fill: #0f766e; }

        .axis-line {
            stroke: var(--border);
            stroke-width: 1.5;
        }

        .grid-line {
            stroke: var(--border);
            stroke-width: 1;
            stroke-dasharray: 2 2;
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        .axis-text {
            font-size: 11px;
            fill: var(--text-muted);
            text-anchor: middle;
        }

        .axis-title {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            fill: var(--text-main);
        }

        .mean-line {
            stroke: var(--danger);
            stroke-width: 2;
            stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
        }

        .mean-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            fill: var(--danger);
        }

        /* Tooltip */
        .tooltip {
            position: absolute;
            padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            color: white;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
            z-index: 10;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        }

        /* Exercise Module Styling */
        .exercise-box {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            background-color: var(--surface);
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .question-item {
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border);
        }

        .question-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .question-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-main);
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .result-pill {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: var(--primary-light);
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 0.3rem;
        }

        .legend-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 0.75rem;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
        }

        .legend-color {
            width: 14px;
            height: 14px;
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        /* Responsiveness */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-container {
                flex-direction: column;
                height: auto;
                padding: 1rem;
                gap: 1rem;
            }
            nav {
                width: 100%;
                overflow-x: auto;
                justify-content: flex-start;
                padding-bottom: 0.25rem;
            }
            .nav-btn {
                white-space: nowrap;
                padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header>
        <div class="header-container">
            <div class="logo-area">
                <span class="logo-badge">AIML</span>
                <span class="logo-title">Discrete Probability Distributions</span>
            </div>
            <nav>
                <button class="nav-btn active" onclick="switchTab('home')">Home</button>
                <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('binomial')">Binomial</button>
                <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('poisson')">Poisson</button>
                <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('geometric')">Geometric</button>
                <button class="nav-btn" onclick="switchTab('exercises')">Lab Exercises</button>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- HOME MODULE -->
        <section id="module-home" class="page-module active">
            <h1>Discrete Probability Distributions</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">An Interactive Laboratory for Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Students</p>

            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
                <h2>Introduction to Discrete Random Variables</h2>
                <p>In Machine Learning and Pattern Recognition, random variables are used to model uncertain events, noise, dataset sampling, and algorithmic decisions. A <strong>Discrete Random Variable</strong> is a variable whose possible values are countable outcomes (e.g., non-negative integers).</p>
                <p>A <strong>Probability Mass Function (PMF)</strong> defines the exact probability $P(X = k)$ that a discrete random variable equals a specific value $k$, satisfying $\sum P(X=k) = 1$. The <strong>Cumulative Distribution Function (CDF)</strong> measures the probability that $X$ takes a value less than or equal to $k$, denoted $P(X \le k)$.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="grid-3">
                <div class="card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--primary);">
                    <h3>Binomial Distribution</h3>
                    <div class="math-block">X ~ Binomial(n, p)</div>
                    <p>Models the total number of successes in <em>n</em> independent Bernoulli trials, each having a constant probability of success <em>p</em>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Common Uses:</strong> Classification model accuracy over batch, A/B testing conversions.</p>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="switchTab('binomial')">Open Binomial Module &rarr;</button>
                </div>

                <div class="card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--secondary);">
                    <h3>Poisson Distribution</h3>
                    <div class="math-block">X ~ Poisson(&lambda;)</div>
                    <p>Models the number of independent events occurring within a fixed time window or spatial region at a constant average rate <em>&lambda;</em>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Common Uses:</strong> Server API request arrival rates, network packet loss, rare anomaly occurrences.</p>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="switchTab('poisson')">Open Poisson Module &rarr;</button>
                </div>

                <div class="card" style="border-top: 4px solid var(--accent);">
                    <h3>Geometric Distribution</h3>
                    <div class="math-block">X ~ Geometric(p)</div>
                    <p>Models the total number of independent trials required to observe the very first success, where each trial has success probability <em>p</em>.</p>
                    <p><strong>Common Uses:</strong> Time-to-failure analysis, search algorithm attempts, reinforcement learning goal search.</p>
                    <button class="btn btn-secondary" onclick="switchTab('geometric')">Open Geometric Module &rarr;</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Laboratory Instructions</h3>
                <p>Use the navigation tabs above or the interactive module buttons to navigate between distribution calculators. You can adjust parameters, view dynamic statistical moments, inspect interactive PMF charts with mean markers, and complete the guided lab exercises.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- BINOMIAL MODULE -->
        <section id="module-binomial" class="page-module">
            <h1>Binomial Distribution Module</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Modeling Successes in Fixed Independent Trials</p>

            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <div class="math-block">X ~ Binomial(n, p) &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; P(X = k) = &binom;{n}{k} p^k (1-p)^{n-k}</div>
                <p>The Binomial distribution describes the count of successes in <em>n</em> independent experiments with success probability <em>p</em> and failure probability <em>q = 1 - p</em>.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Binomial Inputs -->
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <h3>Parameter Controls</h3>
                <div class="grid-2">
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bin-n">Number of Trials (n):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="bin-n" value="20" min="1" max="500" step="1" oninput="updateBinomial()">
                        <div id="bin-n-err" class="validation-msg">Must be a positive integer (&ge; 1).</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bin-p">Probability of Success (p):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="bin-p" value="0.35" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" oninput="updateBinomial()">
                        <div id="bin-p-err" class="validation-msg">Must be between 0.0 and 1.0 inclusive.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Active parameters: <strong>n = <span id="bin-val-n">20</span></strong>, <strong>p = <span id="bin-val-p">0.35</span></strong>, <strong>1 - p = <span id="bin-val-q">0.65</span></strong></p>
            </div>

            <!-- Binomial Statistics Cards -->
            <div class="grid-5">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Mean E[X]</div>
                    <div class="formula">n &middot; p</div>
                    <div class="value" id="bin-stat-mean">7</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Variance Var(X)</div>
                    <div class="formula">n &middot; p &middot; (1-p)</div>
                    <div class="value" id="bin-stat-var">4.55</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Std Deviation &sigma;</div>
                    <div class="formula">&radic;(Var)</div>
                    <div class="value" id="bin-stat-sd">2.1331</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">2nd Moment E[X&sup2;]</div>
                    <div class="formula">Var + (Mean)&sup2;</div>
                    <div class="value" id="bin-stat-m2">53.55</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Skewness &gamma;&thinsp;&frac12;</div>
                    <div class="formula">(1-2p) / &sigma;</div>
                    <div class="value" id="bin-stat-skew">0.1404</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Binomial PMF & CDF Calculators -->
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>PMF Calculator: P(X = k)</h3>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bin-k-pmf">Success Count (k):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="bin-k-pmf" value="7" min="0" step="1" oninput="updateBinomial()">
                        <div id="bin-k-pmf-err" class="validation-msg">k must be an integer between 0 and n.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="math-block" id="bin-pmf-res">P(X = 7) = 0.1844 (18.44%)</div>
                    <p>The probability of obtaining exactly <em>k</em> successes in <em>n</em> independent trials.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h3>CDF Calculator: P(X &le; k)</h3>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="bin-k-cdf">Threshold Count (k):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="bin-k-cdf" value="7" min="0" step="1" oninput="updateBinomial()">
                        <div id="bin-k-cdf-err" class="validation-msg">k must be an integer between 0 and n.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="math-block" id="bin-cdf-res">P(X &le; 7) = 0.6010 | P(X &gt; 7) = 0.3990</div>
                    <p>P(X &le; k) means the probability of getting k or fewer successes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Binomial Chart -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Binomial Probability Mass Function (PMF) Graph</h3>
                <div class="chart-wrapper">
                    <div id="bin-tooltip" class="tooltip"></div>
                    <svg id="bin-chart" class="chart"></svg>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- POISSON MODULE -->
        <section id="module-poisson" class="page-module">
            <h1>Poisson Distribution Module</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Modeling Rare Event Counts per Fixed Interval</p>

            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <div class="math-block">X ~ Poisson(&lambda;) &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; P(X = k) = (e^{-\lambda} &middot; &lambda;^k) / k!</div>
                <p>The Poisson distribution expresses the probability of a given number of events occurring in a fixed interval of time or space if these events occur with a known constant rate &lambda;.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Poisson Inputs -->
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <h3>Parameter Controls</h3>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="poi-lambda">Average Number of Events (&lambda;):</label>
                    <input type="number" id="poi-lambda" value="6" min="0" max="100" step="0.1" oninput="updatePoisson()">
                    <div id="poi-lambda-err" class="validation-msg">Must be a non-negative finite number (&ge; 0).</div>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 0;">Active parameter: <strong>&lambda; = <span id="poi-val-lambda">6</span></strong></p>
            </div>

            <!-- Poisson Statistics Cards -->
            <div class="grid-3">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Mean E[X]</div>
                    <div class="formula">&lambda;</div>
                    <div class="value" id="poi-stat-mean">6</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Variance Var(X)</div>
                    <div class="formula">&lambda;</div>
                    <div class="value" id="poi-stat-var">6</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="label">Std Deviation &sigma;</div>
                    <div class="formula">&radic;(&lambda;)</div>
                    <div class="value" id="poi-stat-sd">2.4495</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Poisson PMF & CDF Calculators -->
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>PMF Calculator: P(X = k)</h3>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="poi-k-pmf">Event Count (k):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="poi-k-pmf" value="6" min="0" step="1" oninput="updatePoisson()">
                        <div id="poi-k-pmf-err" class="validation-msg">k must be a non-negative integer (&ge; 0).</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="math-block" id="poi-pmf-res">P(X = 6) = 0.1606 (16.06%)</div>
                    <p>The result is the probability of observing exactly k events during the specified interval.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h3>CDF Calculator: P(X &le; k)</h3>
                    <div class="form-group">
                        <label for="poi-k-cdf">Threshold Count (k):</label>
                        <input type="number" id="poi-k-cdf" value="6" min="0" step="1" oninput="updatePoisson()">
                        <div id="poi-k-cdf-err" class="validation-msg">k must be a non-negative integer (&ge; 0).</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="math-block" id="poi-cdf-res">P(X &le; 6) = 0.6063 | P(X &gt; 6) = 0.3937</div>
                    <p>P(X &le; k) means the probability of observing k or fewer events.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Poisson Main Graph -->
            <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                <h3>Poisson Probability Mass Function (PMF) Graph</h3>
                <div class="chart-wrapper">
                    <div id="poi-tooltip" class="tooltip"></div>
                    <svg id="poi-chart" class="chart"></svg>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; text-align: right; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem;">Note: Poisson distribution theoretical support is infinite ($k \in \{0, 1, 2, ...\}$). The graph displays a truncated finite range capturing over 99.99% of total probability mass.</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Poisson Comparison Graphs -->
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Poisson Multi-Rate Parameter Comparison</h3>
